 "applies_to": "Accuenergy Acuvim-L series multifunction meters on BACnet MS/TP (RS-485 port 1) or BACnet IP through an AXM-WEB2 module.",
 "summary": "The Acuvim-L serves 71 fixed, read-only Analog Inputs over BACnet: voltage, current, power, power factor, unbalance, demand, energy totals and per-phase energy, and THD. BACnet MS/TP runs on the meter's RS-485 port once Protocol 1 is set to BACnet; BACnet IP needs the AXM-WEB2 add-on module. The same object list applies to both.",
