  "The table has no access column; all objects are measurements and are listed as read-only.",
  "BACnet IP needs an AXM-WEB2 module fitted to the meter; it is configured in the module's web page.",
  "Names for AI 49-60 wrap over two lines in the manual and are joined here.",
  "Features differ between the Acuvim-CL and Acuvim-EL models (see the manual's function table).",
  "Source: Acuvim-L user manual V4.1.12 (March 2026), Table 6-85."
 ],
