 "integration": {
  "summary": "For BACnet MS/TP set the address (S01), baud (S02), Protocol 1 = BACnet (S38), max info frames (S51) and device ID (S52). For BACnet IP enable BACnet in the AXM-WEB2 web page, set port and instance, save and reboot. Read total kW, imported kWh, demand, power factor, current and voltage.",
